Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:06.98,TL,,0,0,0,,温网第一轮 谢尔顿拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.94,TL,,0,0,0,,最后却输掉了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.94,TL,,0,0,0,,两个多月后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:13.16,TL,,0,0,0,,他第一次站上大满贯决赛的球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:15.41,TL,,0,0,0,,先从澳网说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:19.01,TL,,0,0,0,,打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强之后 他{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘输给辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:44.37,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月达拉斯 面对弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:46.99,TL,,0,0,0,,他在决胜盘救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:49.03,TL,,0,0,0,,最后逆转夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:16.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton stands alone in the Lone Star State.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿在孤星之州独占鳌头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:21.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A new champion crowned in Dallas.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达拉斯迎来新王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:24.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月慕尼黑 两盘击败科博利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.11,0:01:26.00,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季第二冠到手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:29.40,TL,,0,0,0,,这一回 他在红土上举起奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:42.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton is the 2026 BMW Open{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿夺得{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年宝马公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:46.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}by Bitpanda champion here in Munich.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在慕尼黑加冕冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:49.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Runner-up twelve months ago.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十二个月前他还是亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.35,0:01:50.46,TL,,0,0,0,,可到了法网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:53.63,TL,,0,0,0,,他却在第二轮{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘输给科利尼翁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:57.34,TL,,0,0,0,,红土冠军 没有变成大满贯突破
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.79,0:02:01.44,TL,,0,0,0,,转上草地 斯图加特决赛又遇弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:02.59,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.59,0:02:05.42,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到生涯第一座草地冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:07.18,TL,,0,0,0,,半个月后的温网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:08.91,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘最后的抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:10.47,TL,,0,0,0,,他曾以{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:11.74,TL,,0,0,0,,还拿到一个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:14.17,TL,,0,0,0,,最终却在第一轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:17.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月 加拿大大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:19.02,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}6{\fs68}场比赛一盘未失
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:22.64,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘击败中岛布兰登 成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:41.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton delivers a masterful performance in Montreal,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿在蒙特利尔打出大师级表现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:44.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that will yield the most glittering of prizes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赢得最耀眼的奖赏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:52.48,TL,,0,0,0,,美网 他第一次击败阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:53.72,TL,,0,0,0,,又逆转蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:56.27,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次打进大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.24,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:00.78,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘落败 收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.04,TL,,0,0,0,,从温网首轮到纽约决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:05.93,TL,,0,0,0,,他走出了完全不同的一段路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:14.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match, Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 兹维列夫获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:19.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Umpire announces the score]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【裁判宣布比分】
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:20.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Zverev doesn't know he's won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫还不知道自己赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.29,0:03:23.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He doesn't even know he's won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他甚至没意识到自己赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:25.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There you go.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这下知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:32.16,TL,,0,0,0,,亚洲赛季 上海止步第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:33.19,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:36.48,TL,,0,0,0,,另一场比赛替他锁定了年终席位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:38.24,TL,,0,0,0,,达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:40.77,TL,,0,0,0,,在上海决赛击败霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:44.36,TL,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿连续第二年 拿到都灵门票
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:48.12,TL,,0,0,0,,资格到手以后 巴塞尔止步第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:50.05,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎先过保罗这一关
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:52.95,TL,,0,0,0,,再从一盘落后打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:55.84,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛再次遇到阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:58.01,TL,,0,0,0,,美网他曾赢下这组对决
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:01.53,TL,,0,0,0,,这次却两盘告负 收获巴黎亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:21.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz wins the Rolex Paris Masters{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯赢得巴黎大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:24.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the very first time in his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他生涯第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.39,TL,,0,0,0,,截至{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}9{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.39,0:04:34.37,TL,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿{\fs78}5170{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.21,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季积分榜第四
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.31,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳已退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:40.58,TL,,0,0,0,,高亮的是本届年终的{\fs78}8{\fs68}位正选
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:44.36,TL,,0,0,0,,错过温网赛点 后来站上美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.75,TL,,0,0,0,,第二次到都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:48.56,TL,,0,0,0,,你看好谢尔顿冲进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强吗？
